{"id":"vod_bf_16821","vodId":"16821","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"进击的巨人第三季","name_cn":"进击的巨人第三季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/93b7477b7ceb39e2c3f101e361b0b227.jpg"},"summary":"历经百年的时光，将人类与外侧世界隔开的墙壁。据说那堵墙的另一边是一个从未见过的世界。火焰之水、冰之大地、砂之雪原……记载在书中的，尽是些激发少年探究心的文字。时间流转，现在墙壁被巨人毁坏，人类正一步步接近世界的真相。巨人的真实身份是什么？为何墙壁中会埋着巨人？巨人化的艾伦·耶格尔所持有的“坐标”之力是？以及，希丝特莉亚·雷斯究竟知道这个世界的什么事情？在艾伦等104期兵的加入下，新体制的利威尔班建成了。开始行动后，阻拦在他们面前的，是最强最恶的敌人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:50:01","classic":true,"classicRank":8,"franchise":"进击的巨人","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jinjidejurendisanji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c